e 0.85 to come without an extensive round of strikes first. 0.75 x 0.85 is about 0.62.\"><p>Kalshi asks a deal before July 1, 2027. May 18 is 180 of the 224 days to that deadline, and Kalshi&#x27;s own ladder puts 0.095 of its 0.205 before March 1, so about three quarters of deals by July land by May 18; of those, I take 0.85 to come without an extensive round of strikes first. 0.75 x 0.85 is about 0.62.</p></div></div><button class=\"linkish more\" type=\"button\" data-more>Show more</button></div></div><p class=\"raw\"><a class=\"rawlink\" data-go=\"raw:value:structure:prop:5\">Full details</a></p>", "wide": true}